---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다 - Dalink"
  description="요청하신 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다."
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[60vh]">
    <p class="text-8xl font-black text-neutral-200 dark:text-neutral-800 mb-6 select-none">404</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
      페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다
    </h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-8 max-w-sm">
      요청하신 페이지가 존재하지 않거나 이동되었습니다.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
    >
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
      </svg>
      홈으로 돌아가기
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
